        "id": "AC1",
        "text": "POST /api/analytics/events accepts the learner client's single-event JSON contract and optional event arrays, and persists event_name, source, payload and nullable identity columns in analytics.analytics_event."
      },
      {
        "id": "AC2",
        "text": "Malformed or incomplete event payloads are rejected with 400; database write failures are surfaced as server errors rather than false accepted responses."
